w: Sweet are the prom-is-es, | Kind is the word; | Dear-er far than an-y mes-sage | man ev-er heard; | Pure was the mind of Christ, | Sin-less, I see; | He the great ex-am-ple is, and | pat-tern for me. | Where He leads I'll | fol- low, | Fol-low all the | way; | Where He leads I'll | fol- low, | Fol-low Je-sus ev-'ry | day.
